node_modules/
# `lib/` is committed on purpose: a git install fetches sources only, and pnpm
# refuses a git dependency's `prepare` script until the user allowlists it.
# Shipping the built entry points keeps `dsh plugin add github:...` a one-step,
# permission-free install. Run `pnpm build` and commit `lib/` with each change.
.pnpm-store/
.pnpm-cache/
.pack/
*.tgz
*.log
.DS_Store
.tmp-*/
